---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About me – Next-Gen Fridays"
  description="Waddup Family, I learned years ago that helping someone else win is more rewarding than me getting my own win."
  ogImage="/images/og-about.jpg"
>
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-12 about-grid">
        <!-- Left Column: Sticky Portrait & Kinetic Shapes -->
        <div class="about-portrait-col">
          <div class="portrait-sticky">
            <div class="about-shape about-shape-square" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="about-shape about-shape-circle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="portrait-card surface-card">
              <img
                src="/images/about-chris.jpg"
                alt="Chris Latham – Host of Next-Gen Fridays"
                width="720"
                height="1080"
                fetchpriority="high"
                class="about-portrait-img"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Story & Bio -->
        <div class="about-content-col">
          <div class="about-card surface-card">
            <h1 class="text-display about-heading">Waddup Family,🤸🏿‍♂️</h1>

            <p class="text-body-lg lead-paragraph">
              I learned years ago that helping someone else win is more rewarding than me getting my own win.
            </p>

            <p class="text-body-lg">
              If you never met me here are the bullet points on what you need to know:
            </p>

            <ul class="about-list text-body-lg">
              <li>I love burgers (mustard, pickles, ketchup, onions)</li>
              <li>I love pistachio gelato</li>
              <li>I watch Youtube videos and listen to podcasts at 2x speed</li>
              <li>I am <strong>RELENTLESSLY CURIOUS</strong></li>
              <li>I love to go down rabbit holes of information</li>
              <li>I’m still collecting stories, just in a new spot now (see below 👇🏿)</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="text-body-lg">
              These days I’m writing about marketing, AI, and whatever rabbit hole I’m down that week over at{' '}
              <a
                href="https://chrislatham.ca"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="cta-inline-link"
              >
                chrislatham.ca
              </a>. I’m also helping people show up on camera and use AI to buy back time for the human stuff at{' '}
              <a
                href="https://thelatham.net"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="cta-inline-link"
              >
                thelatham.net
              </a>. Pull up a virtual burger at either one.🍔
            </p>

            <hr class="section-divider" />

            <h2 class="text-headline-md section-subheading">Why</h2>

            <p class="text-body-lg">
              I started Next-Gen Fridays out of selfishness. I enjoy having DOPE conversations hearing people’s stories. The other reason is to help shake the stigma on the youth being seen as lazy and spoiled.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-headline-md champion-heading">
              I am championing the Next generation of creatives and entrepreneurs.
            </h2>

            <p class="text-body-lg">
              We all need someone to believe in us and our goals to push through the hard times.
            </p>

            <p class="text-body-lg sign-off">
              Enjoy the archive, then come find me at{' '}
              <a href="https://chrislatham.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-inline-link">chrislatham.ca</a>
              {' '}and{' '}
              <a href="https://thelatham.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-inline-link">thelatham.net</a>.✌🏿
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-grid {
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-portrait-col {
    grid-column: span 5;
    position: sticky;
    top: 6.5rem;
  }

  .about-content-col {
    grid-column: span 7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .about-portrait-col {
      grid-column: span 8;
      position: static;
    }

    .about-content-col {
      grid-column: span 8;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about-portrait-col,
    .about-content-col {
      grid-column: span 4;
    }
  }

  .portrait-sticky {
    position: relative;
  }

  .portrait-card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-portrait-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .about-shape {
    position: absolute;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-shape-square {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-neon-crimson);
    border-radius: var(--radius-default);
    top: -1rem;
    left: -1rem;
    transform: rotate(-14deg);
  }

  .about-shape-circle {
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-kinetic-vermilion);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    bottom: -1rem;
    right: -1rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .about-heading {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-neon-crimson);
    text-underline-offset: 8px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 4px;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 30px;
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }

  .about-list {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-list li::marker {
    color: var(--color-neon-crimson);
  }

  .about-list strong {
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }

  .cta-inline-link {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-neon-crimson);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .cta-inline-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-kinetic-vermilion);
  }

  .section-divider {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-charcoal-elevated);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .section-subheading {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-neon-crimson);
  }

  .champion-heading {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }

  .sign-off {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-pure-white);
  }
</style>
